// out: 3
// a rule placed `where statement` rewrites its own result again (card engine-placed-where-chain): each declaration
// word before a statement goes, however many there are (the parser itself drops `public` and `static`)
rewrite loudly $s... => $s... where statement
rewrite gently $s... => $s... where statement
loudly gently f() := 3
gently loudly gently g() := 4
print f() + g() - 4
